{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415037","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415037","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041503701:1":{"text":"偏食は体に悪いぞ。","source_cn":"挑食会营养不良，这对你不好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5552DE6448FCC76E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503702:1":{"text":"お姉ちゃんは知らないかもだけど、グレイヴボーンはご飯を食べなくても平気なのよ。","source_cn":"姐姐，你或许不知道，亡灵不需要吃东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B0F6A799E46F76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503703:1":{"text":"どんなにおいしいものでも、ワタシにとっては石ころ同然なの。","source_cn":"不管是你觉得好吃的还是不好吃的，在我看来都和石头一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9256A6659DC30066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503704:1":{"text":"ていうか、ここにはおいしそうなものが何もないんだもの。","source_cn":"我不想吃东西，那些东西也没一个看起来好吃的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58BF9F4AE9488A42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503705:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503706:1":{"text":"なるほど、ならどんな「石ころ」が好きなんだ？","source_cn":"那么，你比较喜欢哪种“石头”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA57802F9E4C05A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503707:1":{"text":"へ？どゆこと？","source_cn":"你在开什么玩笑？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A52E543FBED2DF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503708:1":{"text":"食べ物が石同然だと言うなら。好みの「石」だってあるはずだ。","source_cn":"食物在你眼里就算都和石头一样，也有相对来说更喜欢的“石...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAC7B9E866652CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041503709:1":{"text":"好きな石を教えてくれれば、あたしが見つけてきてあげよう。","source_cn":"你喜欢哪种？我给你找来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9294B736907A90FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041503710:1":{"text":"ふーん。なら、血の滴るお肉がいいって言ったら？","source_cn":"如果我想要的是血肉呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1DF58C36604528","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041503711:1":{"text":"いいとも。昔みたいに、人から奪ったものや、他人の食べ残しを食べるよりはマシだ……","source_cn":"不伤人，不捡别人剩下的吃就行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x468CCC6AACB019D3","variant_status":"","male":"","